<aside>mura always eclipses: mura <b>m</b>beadh mise = were it not for me</aside>
<aside><b>murar</b> before past tense of regular verbs <small>murar chaill sé é = if he didn’t lose it</small></aside> 
<aside>can incorporate the copula, and in this case if before a vowel, mura/murar becomes murab/murarbh 
