"7277","seisear","six people
<aside>causes genitive plural in the succeeding noun
<br>for 'strong plural' nouns, this is the same as the regular plural:
<br>seisear páistí = six children
<br>seisear dochtúirí = six doctors
<br>seisear iníonacha = six daughters
<br>but certain nouns have a separate genitive plural: 
<br>seisear fear = six men ('fir' is the normal plural)
