"2783","deichniúr","ten people
<aside>causes genitive plural in the succeeding noun
<br>for 'strong plural' nouns, this is the same as the regular plural:
<br>deichniúr páistí = ten children
<br>deichniúr dochtúirí = ten doctors
<br>deichniúr iníonacha = ten daughters
<br>but certain nouns have a separate genitive plural: 
<br>deichniúr fear = ten men ('fir' is the normal plural)
