<aside>if the question is definite 'an é Síle an dochtúir?' (is Seile the doctor), the affirmative is 'is í', which can be shortened to 'sí</aside>
<aside>sometimes (grammatically incorrectly) used as a general purpose 'yes'; the correct way of saying yes or no is to echo the verb, e.g. 'ar bhris tú an fhuinneog?' &mdash; 'bhris' nó 'níor bhris'</aside>","sea",3731,"Copular Affirmative","Noun","","",0,0,0,NA,"","",0,FALSE,NA
